text = "[b][font_size=24]Barn Modules[/font_size]
(# Allowed = 7 - Cost = $10 - Energy Required = 1 - Output = 5)[/b]
These support one herd of Nano-Cows, including all required feeding and milking equipment. They produce 5 commodity units per turn, or 7 if built on a [b]Lush Pasture[/b] grid unit.
[b]NB: Barns must[/b] be adjacent to a [b]Processing Plant[/b]."

