text = "[b][font_size=24]Processing Plant Modules[/font_size]
(# Allowed = 2 - Cost = $10 - Energy Required = 2)[/b]
These turn the output from the herd into [b]Beef[/b], [b]Butter[/b], [b]Cheese[/b], [b]Cream[/b], [b]Ice Cream[/b], [b]Leather[/b], [b]Manure[/b] and/or [b]Milk[/b]. There is no limit on how many units of each commodity a [b]Processing Plant[/b] can make, except that there must be room in the [b]Storage[/b] modules for everything.
[b]NB:[/b] Anything that will [b][color=red]not[/color][/b] fit in a [b]Storage[/b] module is lost and a [b]Processing Plant[/b] requires 2 units of energy per turn, [b][color=red]not[/color][/b] the usual 1."

