bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b][font_size=24]Pasture Dome Modules[/font_size]
(# Allowed = 3 - Cost = $5 -  Energy Required = 1)[/b]
These are enclosed grazing areas, which must be adjacent to a [b]Barn[/b] or [b]Megabarn[/b]. Bad things can happen if there is [b][color=red]not[/color][/b] at least one [b]Pasture Dome[/b] for each 3 [b]Barn's[/b] worth of Nano-Cows (count one [b]Megabarn[/b] as two [b]Barns[/b])."

