theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("5_5vlgg")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b][font_size=24]Catalog Store Modules[/font_size]
(# Allowed = 1 - Cost = $10 - Cash Produced = $10 - Energy Required = 1)[/b]
These allow the selling of tasteful gift boxes of assorted Cheeses, Beef Sausages, and flavourless crackers, usually at higher prices than the [b]Cheese[/b] and [b]Beef[/b] alone would fetch. A [b]Catalog Store [color=red]cannot[/color][/b] function unless there is a working [b]Portal[/b] and at least one stored unit each of [b]Cheese[/b] and [b]Beef[/b]. Gift boxes are made of one [b]Cheese[/b] and one [b]Beef[/b] unit each, and usually sell for $10."

