bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b][font_size=24]Habitation Modules[/font_size]
(# Allowed = 1 - Cost = $5 - Energy Required = 1)[/b]
These are living spaces for the workers of the colony, and are required for the colony to exceed 12 modules. In other words, the 13th module [b]must[/b] be a [b]Habitation[/b] module. Should this module be deprived of energy, then [b][color=red]no[/color][/b] more modules may be placed until it is functional again."

