text = "[b][font_size=24]Construction Modules[/font_size]
(# Allowed = 1 - Cost = $10 - Energy Required = 1)[/b]
These reduce the cost of new module construction by $1 per module, and allow the movement of one existing module, per turn, to another location. However, this movement is [b][color=red]not[/color][/b] free, and costs half of the original purchase price (fractions will be dropped)."

