[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="PanelContainer/VBoxContainer/TabContainer/Modules IV/VBoxContainer/PanelContainer4/HBoxContainer" unique_id=182962212]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("5_5vlgg")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b][font_size=24]Law Office Modules[/font_size]
(# Allowed = 1 - Cost = $15 - Energy Required = 1)[/b]
These are full of greedy corporate lawyers who are eager to sue the udders off the competition. Each turn, a colony can choose to file a suit against another colony for infringement of grazing rights, a strawberry tort, or whatever else they can think of. All lawsuits are decided by the roll of a dice. If it comes up 1-4, multiply by 10, and that's what the colony receives in reparations. If it's a 5, the case was dismissed, and a 6 means the court found for the other colony, who [b]must[/b] be paid $25 in damages.
[b]NB:[/b] A colony with less than $50 in the bank [b][color=red]cannot[/color][/b] be sued."

