theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("5_5vlgg")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b][font_size=24]Portal Modules[/font_size]
(# Allowed = 1 - Cost = $10 - Energy Required = 1)[/b]
These are required in order to trade with the rest of the Galaxy, via Bos III. Prices of the eight commodities are different each turn and for each colony. Each price is determined by a roll of the dice. The price of [b]Leather[/b] can never be higher than 3, and the price of [b]Manure[/b] is always 1.
[b]NB:[/b] Random Events can override these limits."

[node name="How to Win" type="MarginContainer" parent="PanelContainer/VBoxContainer/TabContainer" unique_id=824763925]
visible = false
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_constants/margin_left = 25
theme_override_constants/margin_top = 5
theme_override_constants/margin_right = 25
metadata/_tab_index = 8

[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="PanelContainer/VBoxContainer/TabContainer/How to Win" unique_id=423893129]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_horizontal = 3
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("5_5vlgg")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b][font_size=24]VI. Winning the Game[/font_size][/b]

The colony with the [b]most[/b] money at the end of 15 turns is the winner.

If it is a tie, then you can vote to go to [b]sudden death[/b], where you have 3 extra rounds to try to beat your opposition.

This can be repeated ad infinitum, if you so desire, but has to be agreed to by [b]all[/b] players after every extra 3 rounds.






[b][font_size=24]G O O D    L U C K !!!![/font_size][/b]"
scroll_active = false

[node name="Keyboard and Mouse" type="MarginContainer" parent="PanelContainer/VBoxContainer/TabContainer" unique_id=1327733227]
visible = false
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_constants/margin_left = 25
theme_override_constants/margin_top = 5
