[node name="RichTextLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="PanelContainer/VBoxContainer/TabContainer/About and Credits" unique_id=578435229]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_fonts/normal_font = ExtResource("5_5vlgg")
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b][font_size=24]CREDITS[/font_size][/b]

[b]Space Colony Cheeses II[/b] is based on [b]Space Colony Cheeses[/b], a board game by [b]The Mad Game Designer (aka Michael Fischer)[/b] - (http://www.cke1st.com/m_games1.htm)

The [b]Models[/b] for the buildings were purchased from [b]TurboSquid[/b] (https://www.turbosquid.com/3d-models/3d-model-23-sci-fi-buildings-pack/867011) and were created by [b]kvakling[/b] (https://www.turbosquid.com/Search/3D-Models/kvakling)

The [b]Background Images[/b] are from [b]NASA[/b] (https://www.nasa.gov/) and the [b]ESA[/b] (https://www.esa.int/)

The [b]Music[/b] was purchased from [b]Arteria3D[/b] (https://arteria3d.myshopify.com/)

The [b]Sound Effects[/b] are from [b]Kenney.nl[/b] (https://kenney.nl), [b]Wuzzy[/b] (https://opengameart.org/content/wooden-dice-on-wodden-table-roll) & [b]Jesus Lastra[/b] (https://jalastram.itch.io/50-gui-sound-effects)

The [b]PBR Textures[/b] are from [b]freepbr[/b] (https://freepbr.com/)

The [b]Particles[/b] are from the [b]Particle Pack by Kenney[/b] (https://kenney.nl/assets/particle-pack)

[b]Multiplayer[/b] and the overall [b]Theme[/b] are from the [b]GD-Sync[/b] plug in (https://www.gd-sync.com/)

We have also used the [b]Universal Settings Plugin[/b] from [b]antzGames[/b] (https://github.com/antzGames/Godot-Universal-Settings-Plugin)


[b]Copyright (c) Spinalsoft AU 2025 - 2027[/b]"

